    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Wild King may have a numbers advantage, but we can outmaneuver him with tactics.\r\n\r\nEmpower our living sentinel stones across the encircling hills, they can track Blackthorne movements for us. The northern ridges, the southern slopes, and the western high ground all have drained stones that will activate upon detecting your allied presence.\r\n\r\nTread carefully as you work, Blackthorne patrols crowd these paths, and their presence is precisely why we must bring this land under vigilant surveillance.",
      "dialogue": {
        "9cc958de838d800f3372": "Well done. Your ability to slip through their encampments and enable our sentry stones to establish their bond with our sentinel's sight is a considerable boon to our efforts, $N."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Northern Sentinel Stone empowered",
          "type": "object"
        },
